<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Your domain was removed</title>
  </head>
  <body style="margin: 0; padding: 24px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2933; background-color: #ffffff;">
    <p>Hello {{fullName}},</p>
    <p>Velexis staff removed the custom domain {{hostname}} from your OTA {{tenantName}} ({{tenantKey}}), so the storefront is no longer served on it. If it was the primary address of your storefront, your Velexis sub-domain is the primary address again.</p>
    <p>If you think this is a mistake, contact Velexis support. Your domains are on the domains page: <a href="{{domainsUrl}}">{{domainsUrl}}</a></p>
    <p>The Velexis team</p>
  </body>
</html>
